<h2 class="bold" id="control-types"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="text-input#control-types">Control Types</a></h2>
<p>Although the <strong>input element</strong> <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">type</span></span></code></span> attribute can receive <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input#%3CTextInput%3E_types" class="underline">various values</a>, the <strong>TextInput component</strong> is meant for direct text entry and only supports the following types:</p>
<ul>
<li>email</li>
<li>hidden</li>
<li>password</li>
<li>search</li>
<li>tel</li>
<li>text</li>
<li>url</li>
</ul>
